  "prefLabel": "Plc 310.06 Settlement Procedures; Non-Disciplinary Remedial Actions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 310.06 Settlement Procedures; Non-Disciplinary Remedial Actions. The provisions of Plc 205 shall apply to:\n\n(a) Any disciplinary matter that does not proceed to an adjudicative hearing or that is otherwise settled by agreement between the parties; and\n\n(b) Any proceeding to impose non-disciplinary remedial measures.\n\nSource. #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc300.html"
